  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "Calculate ${lim}_{x\\to \\pi /3}\\operatorname{csc}\u2061(2x).$",
  "worked_solution": "Substituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ directly into the limit, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\pi /3}\\operatorname{csc}\u2061(2x) & =\\operatorname{csc}\u2061(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(\\frac{2\\pi }{3})} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
